+// block (tw tiles, a [32, c_in_p] row-major block) of a unit is tilized from the L1 address the reader published in its
+// slot's entry of cb_src_table: a slab run, the zero block, or the block the reader gathered into the slot. Same tiles,
+// same order as ckl::tilize over the slot (bit-identical).
+// Raw LLK, UNPACK only (capability): ckl::tilize / fast_tilize_block always read at the CB read pointer; the loop is
